lic", "site_admin": false}, "body": "**Description**\r\n14 flaky tests are found using Nondex when running commands \r\n```mvn edu.illinois:nondex-maven-plugin:1.1.2:nondex ``` under the root directory.\r\nThe reason for test flakiness is that for JSON-likes, `build.toString()` eventually calls `getDeclaredFields`, causing indeterminate orderings in the output strings. Therefore, comparing JSON-likes using direct comparison after calling `toString()` may nondeterministically fail.\r\n\r\n**List of Flaky Tests**\r\n- `SamlHooksTest`: basicAdd, complexAddRemove, replaceBasic, replaceComplex\r\n- `TokenHooksTest`: addClaim, addClaims, removeClaims, replaceClaims, tokenExpiration\r\n- `UserRegHooksTest`: allow, complexError, deny, errorWithDebugContext, updateProfile\r\n\r\n**Fixes**\r\nExtract `assertJsonEqualsNonStrict()` as a common method for trait `HooksSupport` and have all tests including possible order permutations call the function instead for comparison.", "labels": [], "milestone": null, "active_lock_reason": null, "created_at": "2022-03-01T14:40:08Z", "updated_at": "2022-03-22T03:52:39Z", "closed_at": "2022-03-21T13:24:10Z", "merged_at": "2022-03-21T13:24:10Z", "merge_commit_sha": "e7dc6a58b8a20448dbcb85a60222a3f0cfc7443b", "assignee": null, "assignees": [], "requested_reviewers": [], "requested_teams": [], "head": {"label": "kaiyaok2:master", "ref": "master", "repo": {"id": 464923600, "node_id": "R_kgDOG7Yr0A", "name": "okta-hooks-sdk-java", "full_name": "kaiyaok2/okta-hooks-sdk-java", "owner": {"login": "kaiyaok2", "id": 47203510, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MjAzNTEw", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47203510?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/kaiyaok2", "html_url": "https://github.com/kaiyaok2", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/kaiyaok2/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/kaiyaok2/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/kaiyaok2/gists{/gist_id}",